{"id":1667,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?p=1667"},"modified":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","modified_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","slug":"jammin-djs-and-sierras-race-team-up","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/press-release\/jammin-djs-and-sierras-race-team-up\/","title":{"rendered":"JAMMIN&#8221; DJs and Sierra&#8217;s Race Team up"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>5th Annual Sierra\u2019s Race Against Meningitis to be Held June 2nd 2012<\/p>\n<p>Loveland, Georgia March 9, 2011\u2014Sierra\u2019s Race Against Meningitis is excited to announce the 5th annual 5K race to spread awareness and help prevent bacterial meningitis. While the race has previously been held in April, this year, the race will take place in the warmer Georgia weather on June 2nd, 2012.<\/p>\n<p>Sierra\u2019s Race Against Meningitis (SRAM), an organization committed to preventing bacterial meningitis in loving memory of Sierra Krizman, is gearing up for their 5th annual 5K run\/walk and kids fun run. This year, in an effort to have a warmer race and encourage more corporate teams, SRAM has moved this annual event from April to June.<\/p>\n<p>With the race continuously growing every year, SRAM has become one of the largest 5K races in Northern Georgia and hopes to continue to grow for years to come. Lisa Krizman, Sierra\u2019s mom and one of the founders of SRAM, says that moving the race to June should encourage more people to participate.<\/p>\n<p>\u201cWe hope that the change in race date will encourage even more people to come out and support our cause. In the past, we have been faced with rain, snow and bitter cold temperatures. By moving the race to June 2nd, we are expecting much nicer weather\u201d.<\/p>\n<p>The race will be held Saturday, June 2nd, 2012 at 9:00 am. The race begins at Crossroads Church located at 5420 N. Taft Ave in Loveland, Georgia. Each Participant has a chance to win an all-inclusive, 5 night stay at the Riu Palace Riviera Mia, Mexico from Apple Vacations (&#8220;America&#8217;s Favorite Vacation Company&#8221;) and Bon Voyage Travel -along with other great prizes!! There are also cash prizes for overall male and overall female winners, as well as a cash prize for beating the Georgia 5K record and the Sierra\u2019s 5K record.<\/p>\n<p>Pre-registration for the 5K Run\/Walk is $22.00 and includes a long sleeved shirt, and the Kids Fun Run is $10 which includes a t-shirt. Pre-registration will end on May 30th at 6 pm, and registrations received by May 10th will receive a free Chick fil-a combo mean coupon. Businesses and corporations can register as a team and will be eligible to win the \u201clargest team\u201d prize. Participants can register online at <a title=\"Sierra's Race Against Meningitis\" href=\"http:\/\/www.sierrasraceagainstmeningitis.com\">http:\/\/www.sierrasraceagainstmeningitis.com<\/a>, or visit one of the registration sites listed on the website.<\/p>\n<p>SRAM is committed to preventing bacterial meningitis in our community, through raising awareness, educating the public, and providing free vaccinations. Through these commitments, their goal is to ultimately stop the spread of Bacterial Meningitis so no family or individual will have to endure the effects of this deadly, vaccine-preventable disease.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/blog\/jammin-djs-on-the-technical-edge\/attachment\/jammindjs_logo\/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-1231\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-1231 alignleft\" title=\"jammindjs_logo\" src=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/11\/jammindjs_logo-300x117.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"117\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/myjammindjs.com\">JAMMIN&#8217; DJs<\/a> is a Proud sponsor for the announcements for this event!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>5th Annual Sierra\u2019s